    <artifactId>vertique-coverage-report</artifactId>
    <packaging>pom</packaging>
    <name>Vertique Coverage Report</name>
    <description>
        Aggregates JaCoCo coverage from every BOM-managed code-bearing module into one
        merged report (target/site/jacoco-aggregate/jacoco.xml) as a byproduct of
        'mvn verify'. Last in reactor build order by construction: it depends on every
        module it reports on. Not publishable: packaging is pom and it is not
        BOM-managed, so the publication inventory classifies it as an aggregator.
        release/tests/coverage-aggregate-contract.test.mjs asserts this dependency
        list stays in lockstep with the BOM.
    </description>

